 "remarks": "Once in awhile a very special rental comes along. This PRiSTINE, upper level, one bedroom CORNER unit is a true gem. Gleaming Hardwood floors throughout give this apartment a very sophisticated look. Large Living room with windows on 2 sides offering tons of natural light. Dining Area just off both the kitchen and living room offers a comfortable spot to dine and/or work from home. The large bedroom offers plenty of room to relax and stretch out. A large FULL bathroom with large vanity with granite counters, tile floor and large bathtub with shower. 2 parking passes offers convenient parking in paved driveway. A large coin operated laundry room is conveniently located in the basement. A private storage cubby is available to the tenant. This one won't last!!!!",
